    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        70.85591465592722,
        835.12152694985,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "CC s'adresse au responsable du traitement des donn\u00e9es. Il lui est \u00e9galement possible de s'adresser au ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52065779714006,
        85.61146155481424,
        724.173526058699,
        19.678960760617656
      ],
      "text": "d\u00e9l\u00e9gu\u00e9 \u00e0 la protection des donn\u00e9es relevant du responsable du traitement des donn\u00e9es. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52068534534897,
        106.50297133939011,
        840.4957073003476,
        19.678948586064053
      ],
      "text": "Les personnes concern\u00e9es ont le droit d'introduire \u00e0 tout moment une r\u00e9clamation aupr\u00e8s du ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52073699824066,
        121.25851823827713,
        420.04130664951106,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "Contr\u00f4leur europ\u00e9en de la protection des donn\u00e9es. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52073699824066,
        142.00393337856167,
        837.598789304932,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "Des renseignements d\u00e9taill\u00e9s concernant le traitement des donn\u00e9es \u00e0 caract\u00e8re personnel figurent ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52073699824066,
        156.90557492174014,
        526.0330231886545,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "dans l'avis relatif \u00e0 la protection des donn\u00e9es vis\u00e9 \u00e0 l'article I.9. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52073699824066,
        177.70946444340223,
        625.6198500282227,
        20.219462246281523
      ],
      "text": "II.9.2 Traitement des donn\u00e9es \u00e0 caract\u00e8re personnel par le contractant ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/SSANWO+TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52073699824066,
        198.54256071936913,
        836.9810895907901,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "Le traitement de donn\u00e9es \u00e0 caract\u00e8re personnel par le contractant doit satisfaire aux exigences du ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52073699824066,
        213.29811979280976,
        840.906761012451,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "r\u00e8glement (UE) 2018/1725 et s'effectuer uniquement aux fins d\u00e9finies par le responsable du ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52073699824066,
        228.05366669169666,
        94.00827149250367,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "traitement. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52074388529287,
        248.94517647627265,
        835.3280352108441,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "Le contractant aide le responsable du traitement \u00e0 satisfaire \u00e0 l'obligation qui lui incombe de donner ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52074388529287,
        263.70072337515967,
        840.0803422935506,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "suite aux demandes d'exercer leurs droits \u00e9manant de personnes dont les donn\u00e9es \u00e0 caract\u00e8re ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52074388529287,
        278.4562824486004,
        835.9480593051122,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "personnel sont trait\u00e9es dans le cadre du pr\u00e9sent CC, comme pr\u00e9vu au chapitre III (articles 14 \u00e0 25) ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52073699824066,
        293.2118293474874,
        835.9499601315266,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "du r\u00e8glement (UE) 2018/1725. Le contractant doit informer sans d\u00e9lai le responsable du traitement ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52073699824066,
        307.96738842092816,
        149.17354260442212,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "de ces demandes. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52073699824066,
        328.8588860309503,
        837.6034208475539,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "Le contractant ne peut agir que conform\u00e9ment aux instructions \u00e9crites et document\u00e9es et sous la ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5207903728954,
        343.61444510439105,
        835.5365975351644,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "supervision du responsable du traitement, notamment en ce qui concerne les finalit\u00e9s du traitement, ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5207903728954,
        358.36999200327807,
        838.6338598798317,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "les cat\u00e9gories de donn\u00e9es pouvant \u00eatre trait\u00e9es, les destinataires des donn\u00e9es et les moyens par ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5207903728954,
        373.1255510767187,
        454.75204814634066,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "lesquels la personne concern\u00e9e peut exercer ses droits. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5207903728954,
        394.01704868674096,
        228.92562287634172,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "Le contractant donne \u00e0 son ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        326.44641324923714,
        394.2654582802513,
        81.36360056165427,
        19.43053899255358
      ],
      "text": "personnel",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/GQXOKM+TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        407.851370559508,
        394.01704868674096,
        524.7889202481201,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": " l'acc\u00e8s aux donn\u00e9es dans la mesure strictement n\u00e9cessaire \u00e0 la ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5207903728954,
        408.772595585628,
        837.8094452931291,
        19.678960760617656
      ],
      "text": "mise en \u0153uvre, \u00e0 la gestion et au suivi du CC. Le contractant doit veiller \u00e0 ce que le personnel ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5207903728954,
        423.5281546590686,
        837.803350251909,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "autoris\u00e9 \u00e0 traiter les donn\u00e9es \u00e0 caract\u00e8re personnel s'engage \u00e0 respecter la confidentialit\u00e9 ou soit ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5207903728954,
        438.4297962022472,
        800.8264224983805,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "soumis \u00e0 une obligation l\u00e9gale de confidentialit\u00e9 conform\u00e9ment aux dispositions de l'article II.8. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5207903728954,
        459.17524786619265,
        844.6277647378256,
        19.678948586064053
      ],
      "text": "Le contractant doit adopter des mesures de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 d'ordre technique et organisationnel ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5207903728954,
        473.93079476507967,
        836.5659363608489,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "appropri\u00e9es, eu \u00e9gard aux risques inh\u00e9rents au traitement et \u00e0 la nature, \u00e0 la port\u00e9e, au contexte et ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5207903728954,
        488.6863538385204,
        541.1156830592677,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "aux finalit\u00e9s du traitement, offrant notamment, selon les besoins: ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5207903728954,
        509.5778879722037,
        21.280991378065735,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "a) ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        146.28111841058393,
        509.5778879722037,
        608.0578668521489,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "la pseudonymisation et le chiffrement des donn\u00e9es \u00e0 caract\u00e8re personnel; ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5207903728954,
        530.4694342804407,
        22.314047490189367,
        19.678948586063996
      ],
      "text": "b) ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        146.28111841058393,
        530.4694342804407,
        786.5679878205337,
        19.678948586063996
      ],
      "text": "des moyens permettant de garantir la confidentialit\u00e9, l'int\u00e9grit\u00e9, la disponibilit\u00e9 et la r\u00e9silience ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        146.28111841058393,
        545.2249811793276,
        447.5206450308969,
        19.678948586063996
      ],
      "text": "constantes des syst\u00e8mes et des services de traitement; ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5207903728954,
        566.1165153130112,
        21.280991378065735,
        19.6789607606176
      ],
      "text": "c) ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        146.28111841058393,
        566.1165153130112,
        786.7764761090425,
        19.6789607606176
      ],
      "text": "des moyens permettant de r\u00e9tablir la disponibilit\u00e9 des donn\u00e9es \u00e0 caract\u00e8re personnel et l'acc\u00e8s ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        146.28111841058393,
        580.8720743864518,
        648.7603110720231,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "\u00e0 celles-ci dans des d\u00e9lais appropri\u00e9s en cas d'incident physique ou technique; ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5207903728954,
        601.7636085201351,
        22.314047490189367,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "d) ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        146.28111841058393,
        601.7636085201351,
        788.8426089944464,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "une proc\u00e9dure visant \u00e0 tester, \u00e0 analyser et \u00e0 \u00e9valuer r\u00e9guli\u00e8rement l'efficacit\u00e9 des mesures ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        146.28111841058393,
        616.5191675935757,
        585.7438348578271,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "techniques et organisationnelles pour assurer la s\u00e9curit\u00e9 du traitement; ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.5208420257871,
        637.4107017272592,
        21.280993099828777,
        19.678948586063996
      ],
      "text": "e) ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        146.28117178523866,
        637.4107017272592,
        786.5659372007333,
        19.678948586063996
      ],
      "text": "des mesures visant \u00e0 prot\u00e9ger les donn\u00e9es \u00e0 caract\u00e8re personnel contre la destruction, la perte, ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        146.28121138578896,
        652.1662608006999,
        794.0083389352224,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "l'alt\u00e9ration, la divulgation non autoris\u00e9e de donn\u00e9es \u00e0 caract\u00e8re personnel transmises, ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        146.28121138578896,
        666.9218076995869,
        791.5328741007713,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "conserv\u00e9es ou trait\u00e9es d'une autre mani\u00e8re, ou l'acc\u00e8s non autoris\u00e9 \u00e0 de telles donn\u00e9es, ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        146.28121138578896,
        681.6773667730275,
        270.45454263329736,
        19.67894858606394
      ],
      "text": "d'origine accidentelle ou illicite. ",
      "font": {
        "color": [
          0,
          0,
          0,
          255
        ],
        "name": "/VWUPMI+TimesNewRomanPSMT",
        "size": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        97.52089540044186,
        702.568900906711,
        838.2248533440022,
